0" end="00:33.890">on </span><span begin="00:33.890" end="00:34.040">the </span><span begin="00:34.040" end="00:34.970">bed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.000" end="00:41.120"><span begin="00:35.000" end="00:35.450">Found </span><span begin="00:35.450" end="00:35.630">your </span><span begin="00:35.630" end="00:36.020">waste </span><span begin="00:36.020" end="00:36.230">while </span><span begin="00:36.230" end="00:36.530">the </span><span begin="00:36.530" end="00:37.160">ember </span><span begin="00:37.160" end="00:37.460">red </span><span begin="00:37.460" end="00:37.880">keeps </span><span begin="00:37.880" end="00:38.630">falling </span><span begin="00:38.630" end="00:39.140">down </span><span begin="00:39.140" end="00:39.410">and </span><span begin="00:39.410" end="00:40.160">burning </span><span begin="00:40.160" end="00:41.060">holes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.120" end="00:43.550"><span begin="00:41.120" end="00:41.510">Until </span><span begin="00:41.510" end="00:41.630">the </span><span begin="00:41.630" end="00:42.110">pillow </span><span begin="00:42.110" end="00:42.260">and </span><span begin="00:42.260" end="00:42.380">the </span><span begin="00:42.380" end="00:43.190">mattress </span><span begin="00:43.190" end="00:43.550">glow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.550" end="00:50.060"><span begin="00:43.550" end="00:43.790">Now </span><span begin="00:43.790" end="00:44.030">I </span><span begin="00:44.030" end="00:44.720">wanna </span><span begin="00:44.720" end="00:45.080">be </span><span begin="00:45.080" end="00:45.230">the </span><span begin="00:45.230" end="00:46.340">tattoo </span><span begin="00:46.340" end="00:46.910">ink </span><span begin="00:46.910" end="00:47.120"> </span><span begin="00:47.120" end="00:47.330">that </span><span begin="00:47.330" end="00:47.780">swims </span><span begin="00:47.780" end="00:48.140">down </span><span begin="00:48.140" end="00:48.320">through </span><span begin="00:48.320" end="00:48.500">the </span><span begin="00:48.500" end="00:48.980">needle </span><span begin="00:48.980" end="00:49.100">in </span><span begin="00:49.100" end="00:49.400">your </span><span begin="00:49.400" end="00:50.060">skin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.060" end="00:52.700"><span begin="00:50.060" end="00:50.150">And </span><span begin="00:50.150" end="00:50.390">I </span><span begin="00:50.390" end="00:50.930">wish </span><span begin="00:50.930" end="00:51.200">I </span><span begin="00:51.200" end="00:51.560">was </span><span begin="00:51.560" end="00:52.670">poisonous</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.700" end="00:56.090"><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:52.970">Like </span><span begin="00:52.970" end="00:53.060">a </span><span begin="00:53.060" end="00:53.780">bottomless </span><span begin="00:53.780" end="00:54.260">sound</span><span begin="00:54.260" end="00:54.260">, </span><span begin="00:54.260" end="00:54.470">like </span><span begin="00:54.470" end="00:54.590">a </span><span begin="00:54.590" end="00:55.310">violent </span><span begin="00:55.310" end="00:55.910">drug</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.090" end="00:58.970"><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.360">Do </span><span begin="00:56.360" end="00:56.630">you </span><span begin="00:56.630" end="00:57.410">remember </span><span begin="00:57.410" end="00:57.560">the </span><span begin="00:57.560" end="00:58.100">knife </span><span begin="00:58.100" end="00:58.310">I </span><span begin="00:58.310" end="00:58.940">kept</span><span begin="00:58.940" end="00:58.970">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.970" end="01:02.390"><span begin="00:58.970" end="00:59.120">The </span><span begin="00:59.120" end="00:59.780">sharper </span><span begin="00:59.780" end="00:59.930">it </span><span begin="00:59.930" end="01:00.170">got</span><span begin="01:00.170" end="01:00.170">, </span><span begin="01:00.170" end="01:00.290">the </span><span begin="01:00.290" end="01:00.530">more </span><span be