0"><span begin="01:12.530" end="01:12.800">I'll </span><span begin="01:12.800" end="01:14.000">decompose </span><span begin="01:14.000" end="01:14.390">with </span><span begin="01:14.390" end="01:17.360">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.300" end="01:36.530"><span begin="01:20.300" end="01:20.990">So </span><span begin="01:20.990" end="01:21.380">light </span><span begin="01:21.380" end="01:21.620">the </span><span begin="01:21.620" end="01:22.220">fuse </span><span begin="01:22.220" end="01:22.880">inside </span><span begin="01:22.880" end="01:23.120">your </span><span begin="01:23.120" end="01:23.660">brain </span><span begin="01:23.660" end="01:23.900">and </span><span begin="01:23.900" end="01:24.980">we </span><span begin="01:24.980" end="01:25.340">will </span><span begin="01:25.340" end="01:26.300">detonate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.530" end="01:38.840"><span begin="01:36.530" end="01:36.770">You </span><span begin="01:36.770" end="01:37.010">threw </span><span begin="01:37.010" end="01:37.160">your </span><span begin="01:37.160" end="01:37.550">drink </span><span begin="01:37.550" end="01:37.700">at </span><span begin="01:37.700" end="01:37.880">the </span><span begin="01:37.880" end="01:38.780">wall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.840" end="01:40.760"><span begin="01:38.840" end="01:38.990">It </span><span begin="01:38.990" end="01:39.410">started </span><span begin="01:39.410" end="01:39.770">raining </span><span begin="01:39.770" end="01:40.010">wine </span><span begin="01:40.010" end="01:40.130">and </span><span begin="01:40.130" end="01:40.460">glass </span><span begin="01:40.460" end="01:40.760">so</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.760" end="01:43.430"><span begin="01:40.760" end="01:41.300">Stay </span><span begin="01:41.300" end="01:41.450">and </span><span begin="01:41.450" end="01:41.810">warm </span><span begin="01:41.810" end="01:41.960">me </span><span begin="01:41.960" end="01:42.170">with </span><span 